<title>Russia's war in Ukraine: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ukraine/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ukraine-2026-11-06T00:28:21.594Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 00:28:21 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Melania Trump hosted Russian and Ukrainian negotiators at the White House, calling for a lasting truce while a cease-fire in Oleshky was exploited by Russian forces to move troops and aid vehicles continued to be hit. Russian drones struck a warehouse belonging to Ozon in southern Russia and a Ukrainian aid centre, killing dozens, and Ukraine launched drone attacks on the Ryazan refinery and on sites in Dnipropetrovsk and Kyiv oblasts, injuring four people. Germany proposed an additional €100 million for Ukrainian infrastructure and Italy prepared fresh military aid despite coalition splits. Battle-related deaths totaled 75,767 in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/5/melania-trump-calls-for-peace-at-meeting-with-russia-ukraine-officials?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/video/2026/11/05/spain-zelensky-urges-latin-america-to-help-repair-ukraines-power-grid&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/05/drone-strike-sets-ozon-warehouse-ablaze-in-southern-russia&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/04/zelenski-makes-surprise-visit-to-madrid-for-talks-with-sanchez-and-latin-american-leaders&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168712&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxQVjJDSVFXTjRQMG1LcGVjOFlhSUo3d3JXTjY1SE44VVFOaGNERmtKVmx6OWo2c19kNXhaTW1JYnJlTzJmbVJRNjZIT1FoV3NpOUVuWlJBaVRaOHVla1lmXy1aNDN0S0ttbmhVYlFnMkFTdU5ZU2pkTTQ0NlhoeDhZVjVxUXlEWGFpTjRha3VHMWZEMFNkU0RJMFduZEQ0cmdJcmZGQmNVZEtRVncxRmcwdkJvRmRxZmpaakVuOXZ3?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/05/world/europ